:"Somebody’s praying with tired eyes"},{"s":15.05,"e":20.25,"text":"We got enough if we open our hands"},{"s":20.25,"e":24.15,"text":"Turn every corner into promised land"},{"s":24.15,"e":29.35,"text":"No more waiting for the world to change"},{"s":30,"e":35.88,"text":"We are the spark, we are the flame"},{"s":35.88,"e":38.78,"text":"We don’t need gold, we need each other"},{"s":38.78,"e":41.46,"text":"Light in the street, bread for my brother"},{"s":41.46,"e":44.24,"text":"Hands to the sky, feet on the ground"},{"s":44.24,"e":47.32,"text":"Love is the loudest sound"},{"s":47.32,"e":51.14,"text":"We can build a different world tonight"},{"s":54.44,"e":56.86,"text":"Different world tonight"},{"s":62.16,"e":64.7,"text":"A folded coat on a church pew bench"},{"s":64.7,"e":67.52,"text":"A paper bag meal and a second chance"},{"s":67.52,"e":70.34,"text":"If you’re weary, come stand by me"},{"s":70.34,"e":73.1,"text":"One small mercy can set us free"},{"s":73.44,"e":77.18,"text":"No more waiting for the world to change"},{"s":77.98,"e":83.28,"text":"We are the spark, we are the flame"},{"s":83.5,"e":86.8,"text":"We don’t need gold, we need each other"},{"s":86.8,"e":89.56,"text":"Light in the street, bread for my brother"},{"s":89.56,"e":92.22,"text":"Hands to the sky, feet on the ground"},{"s":92.22,"e":95.3,"text":"Love is the loudest sound"},{"s":95.3,"e":99.52,"text":"We can build a different world tonight"},{"s":101.98,"e":104.9,"text":"Different world tonight"},{"s":110.3,"e":113.18,"text":"If the night gets long, hold on tight"},{"s":113.18,"e":116.16,"text":"One voice turns into a thousand lights"},{"s":116.16,"e":119.28,"text":"From porch to porch, from soul to soul"},{"s":119.28,"e":124.5,"text":"We make the broken whole"},{"s":125.88,"e":129.12,"text":"We don’t need gold, we need each other"},{"s":129.12,"e":131.9,"text":"Light in the street, bread for my brother"},{"s":131.82,"e":134.58,"text":"Hands to the sky, feet on the ground"},{"s":134.58,"e":137.66,"tex